      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The United States is the region affected by the NSP policy and is subject to specific reporting requirements under 18 U.S.C. §2258A.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the region affected by the NSP regulations, particularly concerning the reporting of apparent child sexual abuse material.</data>
