    <node id="NSP (Non-shareable policy)">
      <data key="d0">NSP (Non-shareable policy)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">NSP is a categorization policy that involves auto-flagging content which should not be shared externally due to its sensitive nature.&lt;SEP&gt;NSP is a policy that prohibits the sharing of certain content externally, which triggers automated detection and tagging for violations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-473f2bf06d33f171c87a07ffb004e486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0da0c71de54e74c0ac0187f2a193d2a</data>
