    </node>
    <node id="U.S. Federal Law 18 U.S.C. §2258A">
      <data key="d0">U.S. Federal Law 18 U.S.C. §2258A</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">18 U.S.C. §2258A creates obligations for service providers to report child sexual abuse materials upon obtaining actual knowledge, detailing specific requirements for such reports.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e0da0c71de54e74c0ac0187f2a193d2a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756580364</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Softblock">
      <data key="d0">Softblock</data>
      <data key="d1">technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Softblock is a user-level limitation that can be applied silently without notifications, impacting user access to certain content.&lt;SEP&gt;Softblock refers to a user-level limitation applied silently without notifications to restrict access or action on flagged content.&lt;SEP&gt;Softblock refers to a user-level limitation that is applied silently without notifying users when a violation is detected.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-473f2bf06d33f171c87a07ffb004e486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da7a22b7b9a22123db9e68fe5baf8f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0da0c71de54e74c0ac0187f2a193d2a</data>
