    <node id="18 U.S.C. §2258A(a)(1)(B)(ii)">
      <data key="d0">18 U.S.C. §2258A(a)(1)(B)(ii)</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">This clause of 18 U.S.C. §2258A details the requirement to report facts or circumstances related to child sexual abuse content to the CyberTipline.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0fb9a7654b3f51aa37fcdfbd958625cb</data>
