      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">This clause of 18 U.S.C. §2258A provides guidelines on the necessary information regarding uploads or transmissions related to reported child sexual abuse content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0fb9a7654b3f51aa37fcdfbd958625cb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
