    <node id="18 U.S.C. §2258A(b)(2)">
      <data key="d0">18 U.S.C. §2258A(b)(2)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">This clause specifies penalties for knowing and willful failure to make a report regarding child sexual abuse content.&lt;SEP&gt;This provision specifies penalties for providers who fail to make required reports under the law.</data>
