      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">This clause notes that law enforcement agencies must maintain confidentiality regarding reports received.&lt;SEP&gt;This subsection emphasizes the confidentiality of the reports received by law enforcement agencies and prohibits disclosure of information contained within those reports.</data>
